  <h3>Recommended Learning Path</h3>

  <ol>
    <li><strong>TestProject</strong> - Understand the minimal project structure</li>
    <li><strong>SyntaxTests</strong> - Learn EL language features</li>
    <li><strong>CHIP</strong> - See a real-world eligibility example</li>
    <li><strong>ChipApp</strong> - Learn application integration patterns</li>
  </ol>

  <h2>Creating a New Project</h2>

  <ol>
    <li>Copy <code>sampleprojects/TestProject/</code> as a template</li>
    <li>Rename and update <code>pom.xml</code> with your project details</li>
    <li>Create your Entity Definition Document in <code>edd/</code></li>
    <li>Create your Decision Tables in <code>DecisionTables/</code></li>
    <li>Update <code>DTRules.xml</code> with your file names</li>
    <li>Create compile and test Java classes</li>
  </ol>

  <h2>Running Tests</h2>

  <pre><code># Run all tests
mvn test

# Run EL compiler tests (128 parameterized tests)
cd dsl/el
mvn test

# Run sample project tests
cd sampleprojects/CHIP
mvn exec:java -Dexec.mainClass="com.dtrules.samples.chipeligibility.TestChip"</code></pre>

